  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Enchants the target's fists for {{math spellPower \"*\" 5}} minutes, raising their damage by 1d4 + {{math spellPower \"/\" 2}}, their Penetration by 5 and their chance to Stun by 15%.</p><p><strong>Cast on the caster:</strong> it also sets Hit and Defense chance from Channeling, to a maximum of 80%, and allows unarmed fighting against armed foes. Against an armed opponent the caster then takes -30% to Defense, Hit and Dodge.</p><p>Recasting replaces the previous Steel fists.</p>",
